{"unit_id":"sjh9714__dsh-movein#card-zh","repo":"sjh9714/dsh-movein","commit":"eac664961b233dcd636e2d6a51943d2258adb46d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-movein 是面向 DSH Web 和命令行的配置迁移插件，可把 Claude Code、Codex 或 OpenCode 的部分设置导入 DSH。它在设置页提供来源目录、迁移类别选择、预览和应用流程，也注册 Claude Code 与 OpenCode 的模型工具。迁移内容包括指令、技能、命令、子代理、MCP 配置及受支持的 Hooks 或权限规则；CLI 还提供 Codex 导入、迁回 Claude Code 和迁往 OpenCode 的路径。适合希望复用现有编程助手配置的 DSH 用户；需要本地配置文件访问和 Node.js 18 以上版本，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["shell/index.mjs:12-60","shell/routes.mjs:8-74","src/client/MoveInSettings.jsx:16-54","bin/cli.mjs:112-152"]}
{"unit_id":"sjh9714__dsh-movein#card-en","repo":"sjh9714/dsh-movein","commit":"eac664961b233dcd636e2d6a51943d2258adb46d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-movein imports Claude Code, Codex, or OpenCode setup into DSH. Its Web page previews and applies selected instructions, skills, commands, agents, MCP, hooks, and rules. The CLI also moves DSH skills back to Claude Code or sends Claude Code setup to OpenCode. Requires Node.js 18+; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["shell/index.mjs:46-60","shell/routes.mjs:8-74","bin/cli.mjs:112-152"]}
